/*!
    \qmlmodule QtQuick.Studio.Components
    \title Qt Quick Studio Components QML Types
    \ingroup qmlmodules
    \brief Provides components enhanced for creating animated UIs.

    Preset components are available for creating differently shaped objects,
    such as arcs, pies, regular polygons, stars, texts, or triangles, as well
    as objects with particular abilities, such as being visibly
    \e flipped between their front and back
    sides, like a card. The components are built on top of
    \l {Qt Quick Shapes QML Types}, with some additional properties.

    The QML types can be imported into your application using the following
    import statements in your .qml file:

    \code
    import QtQuick.Studio.Components
    \endcode
*/
